# All ::4nykey wx ebuilds are broken for eclass consumers, at every version.
# wxGTK-3.2.12::4nykey is a metadata-only wrapper: its ebuild has no src_compile
# or src_install, and it installs no /usr/lib64/wx/config script. eselect
# wxwidgets list reports "(none found)", so setup-wxwidgets aborts for
# media-sound/tenacity and media-video/mediainfo, both of which need
# gtk3-unicode-3.2.
# Masking only 3.2.12 does not help: wxWidgets has no 3.2 slot, so portage moves
# to wxWidgets-3.3.4::4nykey and tenacity still fails. Masking both atoms falls
# back to the stable, self-contained ::gentoo wxGTK-3.2.8.1-r2, which does
# install the config script.
# Cost: ::4nykey's dev-python/wxpython needs wxWidgets-3.3.4:3.3 and becomes
# uninstallable. Nothing installed here uses it.
x11-libs/wxGTK::4nykey
x11-libs/wxWidgets::4nykey
